id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1986-013" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Insurance (Application of Laws) Act
1986</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
